Steps to Deploy Spring boot app in oracle cloud:
---------------------------------------------------
Signup, Signin and VM creation Steps
    1. Signup to Oracle Cloud. In this process you provide your detail, it will ask for card details too.
    After signup process it will ask you to configure authenticater app.
    2. Login into Oracle cloud after signup process completes.
    3. After Login process we go with VM instance creation.
        -> Basic Information and security go with defaults.
        -> When creating instance for first time select Create new virtual cloud network under networking.
        Also make sure "Public IPv4 address assignment" is selected as Yes. If this is Yes then only we can communicate with VM instance via internet.
        Also make sure to download public key and private keys.
    4. Adding 8080 port to ingress, this is important bcz it exposes the port outside.
      - Goto dashboard, click on instance name.
      - Goto Networking tab
      - under Attached VNIC, Click Subnet/VLanLink
      - In the Subnnet/VlankLink page goto security and click on default security list
      - Under Security rules -> Add Ingress Rules
            Source Type CIDR, Keep Source 0.0.0.0/0, Ip Protoc  
      - Make sure the Rule get listed under the Ingress rules.       

Build Image in local and push that image to docker hub.
-------------------------------------------------------
    - Create your spring boot app and make sure it is running in your local by hitting -  "java -jar jarname.jar"
    - Installl docker application in our machine.
    1. Create Docker file in the project
    2. Install docker desktop in local.
    3. Create account in docker.
    4. Build docker.
        In local do this build and run app, 
        docker build -t springboot-app-1 .
        docker run -d -p 8080:8080 --name springboot-app-1 springboot-app-1 
    5. Push the image docker hub.
        Create tag and push the image to docker hub.
        docker tag springboot-app-1:latest pparimi89/springboot-app-1:latest 
        docker push pparimi89/springboot-app-1:latest

